Error [E0989]: this `$if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |     $if x {
    |         ^
 Why: a `$if` condition must be a known-time expression — a `$` binding, a literal, or a pure function call with known arguments (D-WHEN1)
 Fix: use a `$` binding: `$flag :: …; $if flag { … }`
